WEBVTT

00:00:05.892 --> 00:00:07.502
[GASPING]

00:00:09.026 --> 00:00:10.981
I think I just
peed a little.

00:00:12.769 --> 00:00:16.221
Anything else
we should try in here, son?

00:00:16.381 --> 00:00:17.858
Hmm?

00:00:18.339 --> 00:00:19.514
[LI CHUCKLES]

00:00:21.995 --> 00:00:25.042
Charge! [LAUGHING]

00:00:25.085 --> 00:00:26.913
Faster, faster, faster!
[LI GRUNTING]

00:00:26.957 --> 00:00:28.654
Thumb war!

00:00:28.698 --> 00:00:30.134
Reinforcements!
Ooh. Ooh.

00:00:30.177 --> 00:00:31.657
[LAUGHS] No fair. No fair.

00:00:31.701 --> 00:00:32.832
[BOTH LAUGHING]

00:00:32.876 --> 00:00:34.053
Yeah!

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:37.204
This is so much fu...

00:00:37.663 --> 00:00:39.404
[YELLING]

00:00:39.447 --> 00:00:40.884
LI: Here we go!
Go, go, go!

00:00:40.927 --> 00:00:42.712
PO: Awesome!Faster, faster, faster.

00:00:42.755 --> 00:00:44.191
[VOMITING] There, there.

00:00:44.235 --> 00:00:45.716
I'm fine, I'm fine.
[VOMITING]

00:00:45.889 --> 00:00:47.387
There you go.

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:49.602
Dolphin-Style Attack!
[IMITATING DOLPHIN]

00:00:49.666 --> 00:00:51.851
You got me. Dolphin-Style Retreat!

00:00:51.895 --> 00:00:53.287
[IMITATING DOLPHIN]

00:00:53.331 --> 00:00:55.119
Go long, son!

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:57.204
Whoa!

00:00:57.248 --> 00:00:59.206
I wasn't ready!
[LAUGHING]

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:01.121
Coming back at you. I got it.

00:01:01.165 --> 00:01:02.688
I'm going high! There you go.

00:01:02.732 --> 00:01:04.690
Come on, throw it!
[GRUNTS] [LAUGHING]

00:01:04.734 --> 00:01:06.083
I'm coming for you.

00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:08.563
Bring it on, Master Rhino.

00:01:08.607 --> 00:01:10.304
Here I come! [LAUGHING]

00:01:13.003 --> 00:01:14.150
Oh!

00:01:18.748 --> 00:01:21.881
LI: I'm gonna get you.
I am gonna get you!

00:01:21.925 --> 00:01:23.927
I'm gonna get you,
I'm gonna get you!

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:25.711
Psst. Psst. Psst I'm gonna get you.

00:01:25.755 --> 00:01:28.105
Who's got you?
Who's gonna get you?

00:01:28.148 --> 00:01:30.716
Who's gonna get you?
Yeah. Who's gonna get you?

00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:31.891
[WHISTLING]

00:01:31.935 --> 00:01:33.023
[BLOWS RASPBERRY]

00:01:33.066 --> 00:01:34.807
Master Rhino.[LAUGHING]

00:01:34.851 --> 00:01:36.868
What? What's wrong?

00:01:37.178 --> 00:01:38.637
[LI CLEARS THROAT]

00:01:42.554 --> 00:01:43.773
Hello.

00:01:44.687 --> 00:01:46.253
PO: Guys, guys.

00:01:46.297 --> 00:01:48.081
You're never gonna guess
who just showed up.

00:01:48.125 --> 00:01:49.866
Not in a million years.
[STAMMERS]

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:51.434
You just try.

00:01:51.488 --> 00:01:52.869
ALL: Your father!

00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:54.470
Whoa!
How did you just guess that?

00:01:54.484 --> 00:01:55.567
Oh, wait a second.
Oh, yeah, of course.

00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:56.699
We look exactly the same.

00:01:56.742 --> 00:01:58.918
Dad, say hi to my friends.

00:01:58.962 --> 00:02:02.095
Mantis, Tigress,
Monkey, Crane, and Viper.

00:02:02.139 --> 00:02:04.286
Oh, Viper, was it? Monkey, sir.

00:02:04.329 --> 00:02:06.536
They're kind of
my best friends. And this...

00:02:06.569 --> 00:02:09.233
This is Master Shifu.
Legend.

00:02:09.276 --> 00:02:12.758
Uh... It is an honor
to meet you, Master Panda.

00:02:12.802 --> 00:02:14.434
Perhaps your father
would care to join us

00:02:14.458 --> 00:02:15.674
in the training hall.

00:02:15.718 --> 00:02:17.502
Your son will be
teaching the class.

00:02:17.545 --> 00:02:18.819
[ALL GROANING]

00:02:18.832 --> 00:02:20.635
Oh, ho, ho! I'm sure he's tired.

00:02:20.679 --> 00:02:22.420
I'm sure you're tired.
He's tired.

00:02:22.463 --> 00:02:23.726
I'm gonna show him
to the Chrysanthemum Suite.

00:02:23.769 --> 00:02:25.858
What, tired?
No, I'm fine.

00:02:25.902 --> 00:02:27.468
I would love
to watch you teach.

00:02:27.512 --> 00:02:28.774
Trust me, it'll be more fun
just to watch me...

00:02:28.818 --> 00:02:30.386
[GONG RINGING]Fight!

00:02:30.471 --> 00:02:31.690
What is that?

00:02:31.734 --> 00:02:33.045
The Valley's under attack.

00:02:34.127 --> 00:02:35.912
Son? Under attack?

00:02:35.955 --> 00:02:37.217
This is perfect!

00:02:37.261 --> 00:02:38.392
Now you can see what being

00:02:38.436 --> 00:02:39.742
the Dragon Warrior's
all about!

00:02:39.785 --> 00:02:41.802
Follow me!

00:02:43.397 --> 00:02:44.485
[ALL GRUNTING]

00:02:48.402 --> 00:02:51.884
PO: Enemies of justice,
prepare for war!

00:02:51.928 --> 00:02:53.190
Are you kidding me? Whoa!

00:02:55.801 --> 00:02:57.415
PO: Ow!

00:02:57.803 --> 00:02:59.177
[ALL GRUNTING]

00:03:02.286 --> 00:03:04.375
What's the deal
with the green guys?

00:03:04.418 --> 00:03:06.856
[GRUNTING]
Some kind of jade zombies.

00:03:06.899 --> 00:03:08.466
Jade zombies? [GASPS]

00:03:08.509 --> 00:03:09.815
BOTH: Jombies! Jinx!

00:03:09.859 --> 00:03:11.164
Ow!

00:03:11.208 --> 00:03:13.036
[GASPS] Lotus, be careful!

00:03:13.079 --> 00:03:15.187
It's okay, Dad,
I do this every day!

00:03:15.603 --> 00:03:17.352
[GROANS]

00:03:17.406 --> 00:03:19.216
Whoa!
I recognize these guys.

00:03:19.259 --> 00:03:20.957
The Master Badger Twins,

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.436
with their Crushing
Double-Gong technique!

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:23.742
Ow!

00:03:23.786 --> 00:03:25.744
Yeah, that's the one!

00:03:25.788 --> 00:03:26.789
PO: And that guy is...
[GASPS]

00:03:26.832 --> 00:03:29.146
No! Master Porcupine!

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:30.947
[YELPS]

00:03:32.359 --> 00:03:34.231
I thought he died
a hundred years ago.

00:03:34.274 --> 00:03:35.710
These guys are legend!

00:03:36.581 --> 00:03:38.235
Get a quick sketch of us.

00:03:45.764 --> 00:03:46.968
Did you get it?
Did you get it?

00:03:47.157 --> 00:03:48.973
Oh, I blinked.

00:03:49.016 --> 00:03:50.592
Can we get another one?
[GROANS]

00:03:51.509 --> 00:03:53.293
[CHOKING]

00:03:53.337 --> 00:03:55.469
I'm being choked
by Master Porcupine.

00:03:55.513 --> 00:03:56.756
This is so cool.

00:03:57.558 --> 00:03:59.432
Oh! Oh, look. It's you!

00:03:59.465 --> 00:04:01.214
Po, focus!

00:04:01.258 --> 00:04:02.966
"Message from the universe."

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.575
I'll give you a message
from the universe.

00:04:05.579 --> 00:04:06.785
Stay away from my son!

00:04:06.829 --> 00:04:08.265
[GASPS]

00:04:08.308 --> 00:04:09.440
Sorry, Dad.
I'll clean up later.

00:04:09.483 --> 00:04:11.210
Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Not my good pan!

00:04:11.223 --> 00:04:12.420
Uh, take this one.

00:04:13.139 --> 00:04:14.532
[GRUNTS]

00:04:14.575 --> 00:04:16.443
Lotus! Watch out!

00:04:18.666 --> 00:04:19.885
Whoa!

00:04:19.929 --> 00:04:21.365
[GASPS] [GRUNTS]

00:04:21.408 --> 00:04:23.187
Dad, check out
my Dumplings of Doom.

